<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In TeachLM: Post-Training LLMs for Education Using Authentic Learning Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Observations on Anthropic’s <em class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Learning Mode</em>, OpenAI’s <em class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Study Mode</em>, and Google’s <em class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Guided Learning</em></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In TeachLM: Post-Training LLMs for Education Using Authentic Learning Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Overlap of Polygence Data with Top Student Activities Reported by OpenAI</span></a></li>
