</div>
<div id="S9.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S9.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The PolyPilot experiment was created by Robert Beretka, Daniel Horvath, Ross Greer, Janos Perczel, Emma Leyden, Amanda Chagoya, Alex Armstrong, Abdelaziz Tina, Tamas Csaba Kadar.</p>
</div>
</section>
